  "title": "Why Do We Say \"An Apple\" but \"A Ball\"? 🍎 Fun Facts for Kids",
  "cover_text": "A OR AN?",
  "description": "Why is it \"an apple\" but \"a ball\"? Just listen to the next sound! Leo asks, big sister Mia explains, in under a minute.\n\nThe CurioKids Club: short, curious answers to kids' big questions. Subscribe: https://www.youtube.com/@CurioKidsClub",
  "hashtags": [
